> On the same subject, is Archy in danger of hitting a poly trap and turning into
> a newt, or does he have some sort of natural magic resistance?

Many monsters have some innate "magic resistance" (which is something
else entirely than the intrinsic granted by a grey dragon scale mail
or a "cloak of magic resistance"), which grants them a
percentage-based "saving throw" against things like charm monster,
sleep and - polymorph. An Archon _may_ be turned into something else,
but they won't step on a known trap voluntarily and their
percentage-MR is very high, so even _if_ they step on the trap, the
chance of turning into something else is rather small.

